133:| `SurfaceInappropriate` | none | none | unchanged | unchanged | unchanged; surface-policy update |
140:- `scoring::factors::user_feedback_weight(feedback: Option<&UserFeedbackInput>)` (ADR-0114 R1.3) consumes a `UserFeedbackInput { action: FeedbackAction, age_days: f64 }`. Pure; the extractor pulls latest feedback per claim per ADR-0114 §2.
